1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,114
Toilet clogged?

2
00:00:01,405 --> 00:00:02,786
Do not flush again.

3
00:00:03,147 --> 00:00:05,584
Three steps, about ten minutes.

4
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:06,333
One.

5
00:00:06,624 --> 00:00:08,971
Push the flapper down in the tank and

6
00:00:08,981 --> 00:00:11,476
close the valve behind the toilet.

7
00:00:11,667 --> 00:00:12,339
Two.

8
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:15,395
Seal the drain with a flange plunger and

9
00:00:15,405 --> 00:00:17,622
pump fifteen to twenty times.

10
00:00:17,833 --> 00:00:18,529
Three.

11
00:00:18,657 --> 00:00:19,655
Still stuck?

12
00:00:20,109 --> 00:00:22,409
Half a cup of dish soap, a bucket

13
00:00:22,419 --> 00:00:26,900
of hot tap water, wait fifteen minutes,
plunge again.

14
00:00:27,100 --> 00:00:29,517
The full guide with all seven steps is

15
00:00:29,527 --> 00:00:30,594
on the channel.
